WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.948
Allan didn't like high places.

2
00:00:14.949 --> 00:00:19.389
Allan didn't climb ladders.

3
00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:23.621
"No way!"

4
00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:29.427
Allan didn't go on the slide.

5
00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:33.944
"Too scary!"

6
00:00:33.945 --> 00:00:44.254
Allan never jumped off the diving board.

7
00:00:44.255 --> 00:00:49.337
"Not me!"

8
00:00:49.338 --> 00:00:53.392
Allan never climbed tall trees.

9
00:00:53.393 --> 00:00:58.670
"Wait a minute. What's that?"

10
00:00:58.671 --> 00:01:02.230
Allan's cat was in a tree.

11
00:01:02.231 --> 00:01:06.749
It was not a tall tree.

12
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:14.722
But Allan thought it was a very tall tree.

13
00:01:14.723 --> 00:01:20.432
"I can't leave my cat in the tree."

14
00:01:20.433 --> 00:01:25.933
How could Allan get his cat?

15
00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:33.097
Allan called for help. "Somebody help! Help!

16
00:01:33.098 --> 00:01:38.334
Please get my cat!"

17
00:01:38.335 --> 00:01:48.389
No one answered. Nobody helped.

18
00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:54.923
Allan cried. Then Allan's dad came outside.

19
00:01:54.924 --> 00:02:01.364
"Allan, why are you crying?" he said.

20
00:02:01.365 --> 00:02:06.865
"Dad, my cat is up in the tree.

21
00:02:06.866 --> 00:02:14.623
I can't get it." Allan said.

22
00:02:14.624 --> 00:02:18.778
"Climb up here."

23
00:02:18.779 --> 00:02:25.559
Allan slowly climbed onto his dad's shoulders.

24
00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:30.137
"Are you still scared?" Allan's dad asked.

25
00:02:30.138 --> 00:02:34.592
"No," Allan said.

26
00:02:34.593 --> 00:02:39.132
Allan got the cat and held it.

27
00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:45.579
"Don't worry, kitty. You're safe now."

28
00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:49.828
"Thanks, Dad!" Allan said.

29
00:02:49.829 --> 00:02:54.513
He looked at the tall tree.

30
00:02:54.514 --> 00:03:03.219
"Hmmm. That tree is shorter now!"

